{"ID":"20250903201222-ho9h4t0","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250903201222-ho9h4t0","title":"UPL2-13——Virtual Texturing 模块","type":"doc","updated":"20250903203229"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903201711-eu7sdnn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250903201711-eu7sdnn","updated":"20250903202326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Virtual Texturing"}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-e0hs3vr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-e0hs3vr","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Virtual Texturing（虚拟纹理）它是一种按需加载纹理数据到 GPU 的技术，\n它会把大纹理（比如 4K、8K）切成 小块 切片（tile），只加载相机可见部分，大幅减少显存占用，提高性能和纹理细节表现\n它是为了解决 高分辨率纹理带来的性能和内存瓶颈问题 而设计的\n它允许你只加载和渲染屏幕上可见的纹理切片（tile），从而显著节省内存并提升加载效率"}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-c2nxkr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-c2nxkr6","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用场景："}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-rbjd24u","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-rbjd24u","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903201728-3mwxwe5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-3mwxwe5","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903201728-k0qrgwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-k0qrgwe","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"超大贴图资源的场景，使用了非常大的纹理（如 4K、8K、16K 甚至更大）"}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-9ffj042","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-9ffj042","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如：地形贴图，世界地图或大场景地表材质，巨型角色或建筑贴图\nVT 只会加载屏幕上当前可见的部分纹理 tile，大大降低内存占用"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-77jr5hx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-77jr5hx","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903201728-lz7cfct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-lz7cfct","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开放世界类或需要流式加载的游戏"}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-7lzj25i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-7lzj25i","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地图分区或区域化渲染需要按需加载纹理，使用 VT 可以只加载当前区域的纹理数据，减少载入延迟"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-39g3lpx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-39g3lpx","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903201728-bzivi50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-bzivi50","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"希望减少 GPU 显存压力"}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-9gaby0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-9gaby0w","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"普通纹理会完整上传到 GPU，VT 可以只上传可见 mip 和 tile，降低显存压力，避免卡顿"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-tnf82g1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-tnf82g1","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903201728-ygkbrl9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-ygkbrl9","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"次世代 / 大型项目渲染质量要求高时"}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-a79jzlo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-a79jzlo","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"次世代美术资源中，常用高分辨率贴图 + 多通道 Mask（如 ORM、Normal、AO 等），使用 VT 可以灵活地管理各个通道贴图的加载与呈现"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-emgw8to","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-emgw8to","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般在 Unity 中  地形（Terrain）系统、静态模型（背景建筑、大型静态 Mesh）、角色服装（高精度贴图）适合使用 Virtual Texturing"}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-t7gt0n1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-t7gt0n1","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是 Virtual Texturing 不适用于 UI 贴图、小地图、动态贴图、实时生成的贴图、实时更新或频繁变化的纹理"}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-8fhqaib","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-8fhqaib","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20250903202326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250903201728-kjy7vlf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-kjy7vlf","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意："}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-cloaigr","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-cloaigr","updated":"20250903202326"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903201728-lztt9gp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-lztt9gp","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903201728-z8uz884","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-z8uz884","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虚拟纹理功能目前在 HDRP（高清渲染管线）中使用，目前不支持 内置渲染管线 和 URP，并且也只支持少量的平台"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-ix64pow","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-ix64pow","updated":"20250903202326"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903201728-ktjc5ch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-ktjc5ch","updated":"20250903201728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"想要使用虚拟纹理功能"}]},{"ID":"20250903201728-t7b8800","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201728-t7b8800","updated":"20250903201815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们需要在 Project Settings——\u003e Player ——\u003e Virtual Texturing（Experimental）开启虚拟贴图模块"}]},{"ID":"20250903201757-vmsihsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201757-vmsihsj","updated":"20250903202326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250903202326-lotq263.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250903201222-x6blt2p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250903201222-x6blt2p","updated":"20250903203229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Virtual Texturing 模块"}]},{"ID":"20250903201256-gq3tw9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903201256-gq3tw9a","updated":"20250903201740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Profiler 中的 Virtual Texturing（虚拟纹理）模块就是专门用来监视 Virtual Texturing 的性能开销问题"}]},{"ID":"20250903202359-okueylr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250903202359-okueylr","updated":"20250903203229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Virtual Texturing中各参数功能的含义和作用"}]},{"ID":"20250903202427-5vrdayy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-5vrdayy","updated":"20250903202533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250903202533-kvj9nhn.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250903202427-m95h4fx","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-m95h4fx","updated":"20250903203229"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-gz4vpew","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-gz4vpew","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-kv9r5do","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-kv9r5do","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虚拟纹理模块"}]},{"ID":"20250903202536-gyt656o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202536-gyt656o","updated":"20250903202548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250903202548-9gdnqpb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250903202537-2zwzmz5","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202537-2zwzmz5","updated":"20250903202537"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-7wdzahh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-7wdzahh","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-8ncg25q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-8ncg25q","updated":"20250903202553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Required Tiles（所需瓷砖）： 当前视图中、相机可见区域所需要的 tiles 数量"}]},{"ID":"20250903202553-3r308e6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202553-3r308e6","updated":"20250903202556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它表示为了正确显示当前画面，虚拟纹理系统“要求”加载到 GPU 中的所有纹理 tile 数量。\n该值反映了场景中可见区域内纹理数据的需求量，如果数量较多，则说明当前相机视野内需要更多细节。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202427-i6ps8zl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-i6ps8zl","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-onhxijn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-onhxijn","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Max Cache Mip Bias（最大缓存贴图偏移）： 缓存中最大的 mip 级别偏差"}]},{"ID":"20250903202601-z1fzqg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202601-z1fzqg4","updated":"20250903202614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虚拟纹理系统会在不同的 分辨率层级 之间根据视角距离和细节要求进行选择。\n“Mip Bias” 指的是一个偏差值，表示缓存中的 tile 与最佳 mip 级别之间的差异。\n这个值越高，说明在缓存中可能存在更低分辨率的 tile，用于应对带宽或内存限制。\n因此，“Max Cache Mip Bias” 提示你目前在缓存中存在的最大 mip 等级偏差，反映了系统在降低分辨率以节省缓存资源的程度。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202427-3n8u3er","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-3n8u3er","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-jw7pbl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-jw7pbl4","updated":"20250903202619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Max Cache Demand（最大缓存需求）： 当前帧下，对缓存 tile 需求的最大值"}]},{"ID":"20250903202620-3dye7kb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202620-3dye7kb","updated":"20250903202625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当场景中大量纹理 tile 需要加载时，“Cache Demand” 就表示相机视野中所需要的 tile 数量，超过了当前缓存容量时就会出现需求过剩的情况。\n“Max Cache Demand” 告诉你当前时刻系统最需要多少 tile 来满足画面显示要求，值较高时可能暗示缓存容量不足或流式加载无法及时跟上需求"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202427-kxyn6us","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-kxyn6us","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-y8a16fu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-y8a16fu","updated":"20250903202631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Missing Streaming Tiles（缺失的流媒体图块）： 由于流式加载原因，当前所需但尚未加载到缓存中的 tile 数量"}]},{"ID":"20250903202631-dynf8zh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202631-dynf8zh","updated":"20250903202635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这部分指标显示的是在 Required Tiles 中，有多少 tile 尚未通过流式传输成功上传到 GPU。\n如果这个数值较高，说明虚拟纹理的流式传输存在瓶颈，可能导致相机视野中部分区域显示不全或临时使用低分辨率 tile 替代，影响画面质量"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202427-eox9x51","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-eox9x51","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-td3zq22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-td3zq22","updated":"20250903202701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Missing Disk Data（磁盘数据缺失）： 当前所需的 tile 中，有多少 tile 数据还没有在磁盘或外部中找到"}]},{"ID":"20250903202701-3rayhnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202701-3rayhnj","updated":"20250903202716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这种情况一般出现在虚拟纹理系统需要从磁盘读取数据但磁盘上还没有相应的 tile 数据。\n可能是由于磁盘数据未生成、数据损坏或者加载路径问题。\n如果 Missing Disk Data 数值较高，会导致画面缺失，系统可能会使用默认色或低分辨率替代，影响显示效果和细节"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202427-8g71tvf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-8g71tvf","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-2o9c8hx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-2o9c8hx","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"System Statistics（系统统计）面板，它用于显示当前帧虚拟纹理系统的总体运行状态"}]},{"ID":"20250903202731-dr90tjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202731-dr90tjg","updated":"20250903202748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250903202748-6otib8f.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250903202731-v0j1t8h","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202731-v0j1t8h","updated":"20250903202731"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-j0pu1ci","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-j0pu1ci","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-6x3wds7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-6x3wds7","updated":"20250903202752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tiles required this frame（当前帧所需瓷砖）： 当前帧所需的纹理 tile 数量"}]},{"ID":"20250903202752-myr55c5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202752-myr55c5","updated":"20250903202752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"表示 当前相机视野中需要加载多少个 tile 才能正确显示虚拟纹理资源，是衡量本帧纹理需求的关键指标。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202427-j7o7x9o","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-j7o7x9o","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-w3yfcwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-w3yfcwp","updated":"20250903202754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Max Cache Mip Bias（（最大缓存贴图偏移））： 最大 Mip 等级偏移"}]},{"ID":"20250903202755-8imgmjh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202755-8imgmjh","updated":"20250903202755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衡量 缓存中使用的 tile 分辨率与理想分辨率之间的最大差距，值越大，说明显示效果越模糊，反映了系统在牺牲质量以保证性能"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202427-l5ogxt7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-l5ogxt7","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-zmsdp7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-zmsdp7o","updated":"20250903202757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Max Cache Demand（最大缓存需求）： 最大缓存需求百分比"}]},{"ID":"20250903202757-vwequz1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202757-vwequz1","updated":"20250903202757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"表示 当前帧中，对缓存资源的最大占用比例，用于衡量当前缓存压力（接近 100% 说明缓存紧张，可能触发 tile 驱逐）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202427-a6kg738","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-a6kg738","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-qo0tw7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-qo0tw7j","updated":"20250903202800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Total CPU Cache Size（CPU缓存总量）： 分配在 CPU 端的缓存内存总量（单位：字节）"}]},{"ID":"20250903202800-cza1rn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202800-cza1rn0","updated":"20250903202800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"记录 CPU 用于管理 tile 数据结构和调度系统的缓存占用，用于评估 CPU 端 VT 的内存使用情况"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202427-xz2bp73","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-xz2bp73","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-te7tl77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-te7tl77","updated":"20250903202802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Total GPU Cache Size（GPU缓存总量）： 分配在 GPU 端的缓存内存总量（单位：字节）"}]},{"ID":"20250903202803-1ce3esm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202803-1ce3esm","updated":"20250903202803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显示 GPU 当前用来存储 tile 纹理数据的显存量，是评估 GPU 资源压力的重要依据。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202427-o16v5zj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-o16v5zj","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202427-jaq7yej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-jaq7yej","updated":"20250903202806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Atlases（图集量）： 当前使用的虚拟纹理图集数量"}]},{"ID":"20250903202806-j0niyd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202806-j0niyd6","updated":"20250903202806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每个图集（Atlas）是用来存放多个 tile 的 GPU 纹理容器，数量多可能说明 tile 零散或使用不合理，也可能是使用了多个 VT 材质。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202427-1h476bf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-1h476bf","updated":"20250903202811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要关注点："}]},{"ID":"20250903202814-0s74801","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202814-0s74801","updated":"20250903202816"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202816-rqfp9bv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202816-rqfp9bv","updated":"20250903202816"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202816-m6s4ubh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202816-m6s4ubh","updated":"20250903202816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对 VT 的 tile 请求负载"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202820-nnejbt8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202820-nnejbt8","updated":"20250903202820"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202820-znl2f8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202820-znl2f8m","updated":"20250903202820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"判断 GPU/CPU 的 缓存使用量与压力"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202824-it2s2za","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202824-it2s2za","updated":"20250903202824"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202824-iywpmg2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202824-iywpmg2","updated":"20250903202824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"查看系统是否在降 mip 质量"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202827-1qk89i1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202827-1qk89i1","updated":"20250903202827"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202827-iaizd0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202827-iaizd0i","updated":"20250903202827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分析虚拟纹理图集（Atlases）是否配置合理"}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202830-2bfj7yh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202830-2bfj7yh","updated":"20250903202830"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202830-k0vvzx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202830-k0vvzx4","updated":"20250903202830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"识别性能瓶颈（如 tile 需求量激增 vs 缓存不足）"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250903202427-n0cefte","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250903202427-n0cefte","updated":"20250903202427"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250903202833-7mekdb2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202833-7mekdb2","updated":"20250903202929"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Player Build Statisics（玩家构建统计面板）"}]},{"ID":"20250903202900-nqfgrxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250903202900-nqfgrxn","updated":"20250903202901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/